				-- Blue Team preset. Writes atlas1/BlueTeam.json: a COPY of your current settings with blue farming choices applied.
				-- Pick "BlueTeam" in the preset list when you want it. Your live settings are never touched, and if you are
				-- already on the BlueTeam preset it is left exactly as you saved it.
				-- Wiki data used: blue bees and their tokens (Bees page); field bee requirements (Blue Flower Field none,
				-- Bamboo Field 5, Pine Tree Forest 15). Stump Field is left out on purpose (the script already avoids its snail).
				-- off switch: _G.AtlasSkipBluePreset = true
				if _G.AtlasSkipBluePreset ~= true and u63 ~= "BlueTeam" then
